# FloristSocial Design System v2 — Fas 1 filpaket

Detta paket sparar riktningen vi bestämde idag:

* Premium social-commerce design
* Rosa som standardtema
* Förberett för Rose, Lavender, Sage, Ocean
* Header/Footer ska kännas som plattform, inte adminpanel
* Floristprofilen ska matcha mockupen bättre
* Primär kontakt ska vara via FloristSocial, inte email
* Marketplace ska kännas mer inspirerande och bilddriven
* Mobil först: stora klickytor, tydliga CTA-knappar och bottom navigation

---

# 1. Spara som: `components/ui/FSButton.tsx`

```tsx
import Link from "next/link";
import type { ReactNode } from "react";

type FSButtonProps = {
  children: ReactNode;
  href?: string;
  type?: "button" | "submit" | "reset";
  variant?: "primary" | "secondary" | "dark" | "ghost" | "soft";
  className?: string;
  onClick?: () => void;
};

const variants = {
  primary:
    "bg-pink-600 !text-white shadow-lg shadow-pink-600/20 hover:bg-pink-700",
  secondary:
    "border border-pink-200 bg-white !text-pink-700 hover:bg-pink-50",
  dark:
    "bg-stone-950 !text-white hover:bg-stone-800",
  ghost:
    "border border-stone-200 bg-white !text-stone-900 hover:bg-stone-50",
  soft:
    "bg-pink-50 !text-pink-700 hover:bg-pink-100",
};

export default function FSButton({
  children,
  href,
  type = "button",
  variant = "primary",
  className = "",
  onClick,
}: FSButtonProps) {
  const classes = `inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-5 text-sm font-bold transition ${variants[variant]} ${className}`;

  if (href) {
    return (
      <Link href={href} className={classes}>
        {children}
      </Link>
    );
  }

  return (
    <button type={type} onClick={onClick} className={classes}>
      {children}
    </button>
  );
}
